+# Aegis Hardening: Deploy & Validate (A–F)
+
+This runbook summarizes steps to deploy and validate the full set of hardening components (A–F).
+
+Prereqs
+- kube admin access to cluster (kubeconfig)
+- S3 evidence bucket configured and accessible
+- cosign installed and KMS key(s) provisioned
+- container images built and pushed: admission webhook, moderation, quota-service, ops tools, finance endpoint
+
+High-level steps
+1. Webhook & runtime isolation
+   - Generate certs: ops/webhook/generate_selfsigned_cert.sh → create secret webhook-tls
+   - Create secret aegis-cosign-pubkey with cosign public key (pubkey.pem)
+   - Apply deploy/webhook/deployment-cosign.yaml and deploy/webhook/validatingwebhook-config.yaml (replace CA)
+   - Run ops/cluster/runtime_validator_enhanced.py to detect nodes missing runsc/kata; label nodes or remediate nodes
+   - Acceptance: webhook denies unsigned pods in protected namespaces and allows cosign-signed images with runtimeClass runsc
+
+2. Watermark forensic readiness
+   - Configure WATERMARK_VENDOR_MODE to "local" or "remote"
+   - Run services/serving/diffusers/watermark/scale_test.py across sample images, iterate until detection target
+   - Use services/serving/diffusers/watermark/forensic_reporter.py to produce signed forensic bundles
+   - Acceptance: watermark CI gate passes (detection >= configured threshold)
+
+3. Moderation maturity & SLA
+   - Deploy moderation reviewer (deploy/moderation/reviewer-deployment.yaml)
+   - Run services/serving/diffusers/moderation_evaluator.evaluate_jsonl on labeled dataset to calibrate thresholds
+   - Configure moderation_reassign CronJob (or run periodically) to escalate stale items
+   - Acceptance: false negative/positive targets met on eval dataset; reviewer backlog within SLA
+
+4. Autoscaling validation
+   - Deploy redis_exporter (deploy/monitoring/redis-exporter-deploy.yaml) and dcgm-exporter (deploy/monitoring/dcgm-exporter-deploy.yaml)
+   - Apply KEDA scaledobject (deploy/keda/diffusers-scaledobject.yaml)
+   - Run queue_load_test and use ops/monitoring/autoscaler_tuner.py to tune threshold/maxReplicas
+   - Acceptance: KEDA scales predictably in staging
+
+5. Billing & quota enforcement
+   - Deploy quota service (deploy/quota/quota-service-deployment.yaml) and wire gateway to call it
+   - Deploy finance reconcile cron job (deploy/finance/reconcile-cronjob.yaml)
+   - Acceptance: gateway preflight rejects jobs exceeding quota; reconciliation clears backlog daily
+
+6. Reproducibility & policy CI
+   - Ensure cosign KMS key configured and cosign_kms_signer.py available in ops tools image
+   - Wire .github/workflows/model_promotion_gate.yml and .github/workflows/full_policy_pipeline.yml to your CI
+   - Acceptance: model promotions blocked until watermark/moderation/repro gates pass
+
+Notes
+- This runbook complements the code in the repository; it is intended for SRE/Platform teams to operate.
+- Replace placeholder secrets & images prior to applying manifests.
+
